WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.400
Motion design: an eye wakes up and looks around

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.300
until a hand reaches in and catches it

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.100
VANTA: a perfume film for a fragrance I invented,
made with AI generation

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.600
NABDIA: a dual-screen health kiosk,
curved display above, touch console below

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.100
Log in, scan vitals, book a doctor:
a working demo

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.600
Short-form films for food, fashion
and jewellery brands

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.900
Motion design, editing and finishing by me

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.600
Reels built in code: charts, counters
and app screens animated in Remotion

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:35.300
A 3D character in a forest scene

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.200
Nexus AI: a launch film for an agentic
threat-intelligence platform

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:42.900
Script, storyboard, design, motion and edit,
all by one person

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.100
Product screens tracked onto a phone
in live-action footage

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.200
A smart-speaker spot with on-screen type
